            <strong>21:30 GMT → 02:30 PKT (Next Day)</strong><br />
            21:30 (9:30 PM) GMT translates to 02:30 AM PKT on the next calendar day in Pakistan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent);">Example 11: Late Night GMT</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">
