        <li><strong>GMT 19:00:</strong> Results in PKT 00:00 (midnight) on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 21:00:</strong> Results in PKT 02:00 AM on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 23:00:</strong> Results in PKT 04:00 AM on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
